================================================================================
                        CONTRIBUTOR PERMISSION PROCESS
================================================================================

STEP 1: Submit Request
    - Go to https://github.com/DAPOWER99/SuperSRT/issues
    - Create a new issue with "[CONTRIBUTOR REQUEST]" in the title
    - Explain what you want to modify and why
    - Provide a detailed description of proposed changes
    - Include a timeline for completion

STEP 2: Review
    - Owner reviews the request
    - May ask for clarification
    - May request additional information
    - Evaluation takes up to 30 days

STEP 3: Decision
    - Approved: You become a Contributor
    - Denied: Explanation provided
    - Conditional: Requirements specified

STEP 4: Sign CLA
    - Sign the Contributor License Agreement
    - Agree to contribution terms
    - Acknowledge ownership transfer

STEP 5: Contribute
    - Make your modifications
    - Follow coding standards
    - Document changes
    - Submit pull request

